  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "实习感觉怎么样？  (How Does the Internship Feel?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fang": "方老师",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside his office, Professor Fang checks in with Bu Xiaogu and Qin Xiao about their television station internships and warns them how fierce the hiring competition is. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "实习感觉怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "感觉非常好，还要谢谢方老师推荐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "老师，我稍微感觉有点失望。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不要太着急了，招聘竞争都很激烈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "最后留下的概率并不是很高。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你们俩要做好思想准备。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我还约了人，你们先回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没问题，老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你也不用太悲观了，可以试试云海卫视。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go through their exchange line by line. Professor Fang opens with a warm check-in question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "实习感觉怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How does the internship feel?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "感觉非常好，还要谢谢方老师推荐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It feels great, and I also want to thank Professor Fang for the recommendation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "老师，我稍微感觉有点失望。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Professor, I feel slightly disappointed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不要太着急了，招聘竞争都很激烈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not get too anxious; the hiring competition is very fierce.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "最后留下的概率并不是很高。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chance of staying on at the end is really not very high.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你们俩要做好思想准备。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two of you need to be mentally prepared.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我还约了人，你们先回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I also have an appointment with someone; you two head back first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没问题，老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No problem, Professor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你也不用太悲观了，可以试试云海卫视。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not need to be too pessimistic either; you can try Yunhai Television.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "实习感觉怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "感觉非常好，还要谢谢方老师推荐。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "老师，我稍微感觉有点失望。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不要太着急了，招聘竞争都很激烈。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "最后留下的概率并不是很高。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你们俩要做好思想准备。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我还约了人，你们先回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没问题，老师。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你也不用太悲观了，可以试试云海卫视。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Professor Fang sends his two students off just before his visitor arrives with an unexpected offer. You heard how to ask \"zenmeyang\", say \"mei wenti\", and soften a suggestion by doubling a word like \"shishi\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
